title: "Reliable Tool Routing — Egress Gateway Showcase"
authors:
  - family-names: "Reddi"
    given-names: "Sai Gowtham"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
# repository-code: TBD on publication
abstract: >
  A bounded laboratory evaluation of a pre-dispatch egress gateway for
  LLM tool calls: host filtering, bounded payload decoding, field-level
  authorization against permission records, and identity-bound task
  context — plus a CaMeL policy-component compatibility comparison and
  a claim-to-evidence methodology. Fictional data, mock receivers, and
  a local model only; not a production system or a novel security
  mechanism.
date-released: 2026-10-20
